Description:
    Creates a freezer class for a model in lib/freezers.

    With no attributes, every column of the model is frozen. This needs a
    database connection. Pass attributes to freeze only those instead.

Example:
    rails g freezer User
    rails g freezer User name email
    rails g freezer Admin::User

    creates lib/freezers/user_freezer.rb
    creates lib/freezers/admin/user_freezer.rb
